### Adding New Tools

1. Create tool definition in `src/tools/`:
   ```python
   from src.models import MyToolRequest, MyToolResponse
   
   async def my_tool(param: str) -> dict:
       """Tool implementation"""
       return {"result": param}
   ```

2. Add to `orchestrator.py`:
   ```python
   @Tool(name="my_tool", description="...")
   async def my_tool(param: str):
       request = MyToolRequest(param=param)
       return await self._execute_my_tool(request)
   ```

3. Add type models to `models.py`

4. Add tests to `tests/test_agent.py`

## Deployment

### Docker Build

```bash
# Build image
docker build -t {{agent_slug}}:latest .

# Run with environment
docker run -e FOUNDRY_PROJECT_CONNECTION_STRING=... {{agent_slug}}:latest
```

### Deploy to Foundry

```bash
# Build and push to ACR
az acr build --registry <acr> \
  --image {{agent_slug}}:latest \
  --file Dockerfile .

# Deploy agent
azd ai agent deploy
```

### Azure Container Apps

```bash
# Deploy to ACA
az containerapp create \
  --resource-group <rg> \
  --name {{agent_slug}} \
  --image {{agent_slug}}:latest \
  --environment <env> \
  --env-vars FOUNDRY_PROJECT_CONNECTION_STRING=...
```

