## Troubleshooting

### 401 Unauthorized

**Cause:** Azure authentication failure or invalid Foundry connection string.

**Solution:**
```bash
# Verify Azure login
az account show

# Verify Foundry connection string format
echo $FOUNDRY_PROJECT_CONNECTION_STRING
# Should be: https://<project>.projects.ai.azure.com/<subscription>/resourceGroups/<rg>/providers/Microsoft.AI/projects/<project>?auth=...
```

### Tool Timeout

**Cause:** Tool execution exceeds `TOOL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`

**Solution:** Increase timeout in `.env`:
```bash
TOOL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=60
```

### Model Not Found

**Cause:** Model not deployed in Foundry project

**Solution:**
```bash
# List available models
az ai project list-models --resource-group <rg> --name <project>

# Update MODEL_NAME in .env
```

